    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "original_book_title_12_01_A",
      "hash64": "F43324FD792A21BB",
      "text": "An Imagined Pokémon",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_12_01_A",
      "hash64": "36C0F6E8CB473B81",
      "text": "A drawing of a fantastical Pokémon\\nas envisioned by our sketch artist.\\nThe size and ferocity of the strange\\nPokémon that dwell in Area Zero’s\\nlower reaches tickled the artist’s\\nimagination, prompting this sketch\\nof what other species that inhabit\\nthese depths might look like.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "original_book_title_12_01_B",
      "hash64": "F43325FD792A236E",
      "text": "An Imagined Pokémon",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_12_01_B",
      "hash64": "36C0F3E8CB473668",
      "text": "A drawing of a fantastical Pokémon\\nas envisioned by our sketch artist.\\nThe compactness and cruelty of the\\nstrange Pokémon that dwell in Area\\nZero’s lower reaches tickled the\\nartist’s imagination, prompting this\\nsketch of what other species that\\ninhabit these depths might look like.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "original_book_title_13_01",
      "hash64": "43F02FC8DCEEC2E2",
      "text": "A Phantom Memory",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_13_01",
      "hash64": "540B055D9803AAAC",
      "text": "During our exploration of Area\\nZero’s depths, I—Heath—strayed\\nfrom the team and was later found\\nunconscious. When awoken, I could\\nonly recall speaking with someone in\\nan unfamiliar place, as if in a dream.\\nI was found holding the page shown\\nhere. The handwriting is my own, but\\nI have no memory of writing this.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "original_book_title_14_01",
      "hash64": "4C527803069DFAF1",
      "text": "A ■isk P■é■n?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "original_book_honbun_14_01",
      "hash64": "22661533DECAD327",
      "text": "While sep■ated from the resea■h\\nteam in the crater’s dep■s, I found\\na s■ange...en■ty. Whether it was a\\n■kémo■, or even ■liv■ at all, I\\nkn■w no■. It bore a s■ll with\\nlayers of o■rlapping he■gons, and\\nglea■d brig■er still than ■mstone.\\nVie■d as a whole, it res■led a\\nmys■ious, ■illiant d■sk.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
